{
  "url": "https://new.web.cafe/tutorial/detail/mi1hiye61y",
  "title": "怎样用 browser-use 发外链",
  "author": "老菜",
  "authorAvatar": "https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/mi1hiye61y_avatar.jpg",
  "tags": [],
  "content": "<div>browser-use 是一款具有 Agent 功能的浏览器控制程序，可以实现浏览器自动化操作。\n大家可能知道 Manus 项目就使用了 browser-use 来操控浏览器，但对其具体用法可能还不太了解。</div>\n<div>尽管目前 browser-use 在任务拆解和复杂场景判断方面仍有提升空间，但在执行简单任务方面已经相当实用。</div>\n<div>本文将重点介绍 browser-use 的安装和基本使用方法，演示如何执行一个简单的自动化任务，并简要拓展如何处理稍微复杂的任务。</div>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">安装环境</h2>\n<div>可以先下载我的代码。\n<a href=\"https://github.com/oldcai/submit-a-tool\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://github.com/oldcai/submit-a-tool</a></div>\n<div>Python版本要求：  <code>Python&gt;=3.11</code>\n安装</div>\n<pre><div style=\"color: black; background: transparent; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; white-space: pre; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none; padding: 0px; margin: 0.5em 0px; overflow: initial; display: block; border: none;\"><code class=\"language-javascript\" style=\"white-space: pre; color: black; background: none; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none;\"><span>pip install </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">-</span><span>r requirements</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">txt</span><span>\n</span>playwright install chromium</code></div></pre>\n<div>设置环境变量\n.env</div>\n<pre><div style=\"color: black; background: transparent; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; white-space: pre; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none; padding: 0px; margin: 0.5em 0px; overflow: initial; display: block; border: none;\"><code class=\"language-javascript\" style=\"white-space: pre; color: black; background: none; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none;\"><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">OPENAI_API_KEY</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">=</span><span>\n</span><span></span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">CLAUDE_API_KEY</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">=</span><span>\n</span><span></span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">SUBMIT_ACCOUNT_PASSWORD</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">=</span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">Aa123</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">!</span><span>@#</span></code></div></pre>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">导航/目录提交</h2>\n<div>导航提交一般不需要邮箱验证，比博客评论少一个环节，更容易成功，所以我们用它作为例子。</div>\n<div>我整理了一些能成功提交的导航站在 <a href=\"https://submitatool.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://submitatool.com/</a></div>\n<div>选其中前两个网站作为例子。</div>\n<div>我们新建一个文件 <code>inputs/dirs.txt</code> ，里面写入：</div>\n<pre><div style=\"color: black; background: transparent; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; white-space: pre; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none; padding: 0px; margin: 0.5em 0px; overflow: initial; display: block; border: none;\"><code class=\"language-javascript\" style=\"white-space: pre; color: black; background: none; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none;\"><span class=\"token literal-property\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">https</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">:</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span>aitools</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">neilpatel</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">com</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span>submit</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span>\n</span><span></span><span class=\"token literal-property\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">https</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">:</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span>www</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">futuretools</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">io</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span>submit</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">-</span><span>a</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">-</span><span>tool</span></code></div></pre>\n<div>我们要提交的网站相关信息写到<code>inputs/img2img/context.txt</code></div>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.25rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">运行命令</h3>\n<pre><div style=\"color: black; background: transparent; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; white-space: pre; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none; padding: 0px; margin: 0.5em 0px; overflow: initial; display: block; border: none;\"><code class=\"language-javascript\" style=\"white-space: pre; color: black; background: none; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none;\"><span>python submit_a_tool</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">py</span><span> inputs</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span>dirs</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">txt</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">--</span><span>site_info inputs</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span>img2img</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span>context</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">txt</span></code></div></pre>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.25rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">context.txt格式</h3>\n<div>context.txt中写清楚你表格里面要填的信息，可以多，但最好不要少。\n图片也一起复制到<code>inputs/</code>，并且在context.txt中写清楚路径。我有验证图片文件是否在inputs/下，拒绝其他路径，这样比较安全。</div>\n<div>最终的context.txt文件例子：</div>\n<pre><div style=\"color: black; background: transparent; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; white-space: pre; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none; padding: 0px; margin: 0.5em 0px; overflow: initial; display: block; border: none;\"><code class=\"language-javascript\" style=\"white-space: pre; color: black; background: none; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none;\"><span class=\"token literal-property\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">Name</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">:</span><span> </span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">Albert</span><span> </span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">Cai</span><span>\n</span><span></span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">Email</span><span> address</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">:</span><span> oldcai</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">com</span><span>@gmail</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">com</span><span>\n</span>\n<span></span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">Phone</span><span> number</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">:</span><span> xxxx\n</span>\n<span></span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">Project</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">Tool</span><span> </span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">Name</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">:</span><span> </span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">Image</span><span> to </span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">Image</span><span> </span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">Generator</span><span>\n</span>\n<span></span><span class=\"token literal-property\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">Services</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">:</span><span> </span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">Image</span><span> </span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">Generation</span><span>\n</span>\n<span></span><span class=\"token literal-property\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">Category</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">:</span><span> </span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">Art</span><span>\n</span>\n<span></span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">Pricing</span><span> </span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">Model</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">:</span><span> </span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">Freemium</span><span>\n</span>\n<span></span><span class=\"token literal-property\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">Website</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">:</span><span> https</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">:</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span class=\"token regex-delimiter\" style=\"color: rgb(238, 153, 0);\">/</span><span class=\"token regex-source language-regex\" style=\"color: rgb(238, 153, 0);\">image-to-image.com</span><span class=\"token regex-delimiter\" style=\"color: rgb(238, 153, 0);\">/</span><span>\n</span>\n<span></span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">Feature</span><span> </span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">Image</span><span> </span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">Path</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">:</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span>mnt</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span>nvme</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span>albert</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span>browseruse</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span>inputs</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span>img2img</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span>feature</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">jpg</span><span>\n</span>\n<span></span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">UI</span><span> image path</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">:</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span>mnt</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span>nvme</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span>albert</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span>browseruse</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span>inputs</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span>img2img</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span>ui</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">jpg</span><span>\n</span>\n<span></span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">LOGO</span><span> </span><span class=\"token literal-property\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">path</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">:</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span>mnt</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span>nvme</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span>albert</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span>browseruse</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span>inputs</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span>img2img</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span>logo</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">png</span><span>\n</span>\n<span>subject</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">Tagline</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">,</span><span> short description</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">:</span><span> </span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">Image</span><span> to </span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">Image</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">AI</span><span> </span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">Generator</span><span> </span><span class=\"token control-flow\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 119, 170);\">for</span><span> free</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">!</span><span>\n</span>\n<span>message</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">Long</span><span> description</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">:</span><span> </span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">Our</span><span> </span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">Image</span><span> to </span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">Image</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">AI</span><span> transforms your photos </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 119, 170);\">with</span><span> stunning realism and diverse artistic styles</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span> </span><span class=\"token property-access maybe-class-name\">Create</span><span> exactly what you envision </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 119, 170);\">with</span><span> the most versatile </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">AI</span><span> image generator</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span>\n</span></code></div></pre>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.25rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">我们接着看案例</h3>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/mi1hiye61y_img1.png\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-03-24 at 5.06.49 pm.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>第一个网站需要上传图片。\n这个对人类来说不难，但是browser-use可能由于安全原因并没有直接支持。我们需要想办法自己支持，这就要用到自定义工具。</div>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.25rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">自定义工具</h3>\n<div>我们知道 browser-use 有一定的agent能力，它会让 LLM 来使用一系列的工具来完成任务。</div>\n<div>它本身支持的任务可以在 <a href=\"https://github.com/browser-use/browser-use/blob/main/browser_use/controller/service.py\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">service.py</a> 中查看，常用的有比如：鼠标滚动，点击元素，下拉菜单，按键，切换标签，回退到上一页等。</div>\n<div><strong>我们要让它支持额外的任务就需要自定义工具。</strong></div>\n<div>支持上传图片的实现方式：</div>\n<pre><div style=\"color: black; background: transparent; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; white-space: pre; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none; padding: 0px; margin: 0.5em 0px; overflow: initial; display: block; border: none;\"><code class=\"language-javascript\" style=\"white-space: pre; color: black; background: none; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none;\"><span>@controller</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token method property-access\" style=\"color: rgb(221, 74, 104);\">action</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">(</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 153, 0);\">'Upload file to interactive element with file path'</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">)</span><span>\n</span><span></span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 119, 170);\">async</span><span> def </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(221, 74, 104);\">upload_file</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">(</span><span>index</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">:</span><span> int</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">,</span><span> </span><span class=\"token literal-property\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">path</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">:</span><span> str</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">,</span><span> </span><span class=\"token literal-property\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">browser</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">:</span><span> </span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">BrowserContext</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">,</span><span> </span><span class=\"token literal-property\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">available_file_paths</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">:</span><span> list</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">[</span><span>str</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">]</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">)</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">:</span><span>\n</span><span>\t</span><span class=\"token control-flow\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 119, 170);\">if</span><span> not </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(221, 74, 104);\">any</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">(</span><span>path</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token method property-access\" style=\"color: rgb(221, 74, 104);\">startswith</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">(</span><span>p</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">)</span><span> </span><span class=\"token control-flow\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 119, 170);\">for</span><span> p </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 119, 170);\">in</span><span> available_file_paths</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">)</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">:</span><span>\n</span><span>\t\t</span><span class=\"token control-flow\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 119, 170);\">return</span><span> </span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\" style=\"color: rgb(221, 74, 104);\">ActionResult</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">(</span><span>error</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">=</span><span>f</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 153, 0);\">'File path {path} is not available. Available file paths: {available_file_paths}'</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">)</span><span>\n</span>\n<span>\t</span><span class=\"token control-flow\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 119, 170);\">if</span><span> not os</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: 