<span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">)</span><span>\n</span><span>\t\tmsg </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">=</span><span> f</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 153, 0);\">'Successfully uploaded file to index {index}'</span><span>\n</span><span>\t\t</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(221, 74, 104);\">print</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">(</span><span>msg</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">)</span><span>\n</span><span>\t\t</span><span class=\"token control-flow\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 119, 170);\">return</span><span> </span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\" style=\"color: rgb(221, 74, 104);\">ActionResult</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">(</span><span>extracted_content</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">=</span><span>msg</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">,</span><span> include_in_memory</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">=</span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">True</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">)</span><span>\n</span><span>\texcept </span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">Exception</span><span> </span><span class=\"token module\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 119, 170);\">as</span><span> </span><span class=\"token literal-property\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">e</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">:</span><span>\n</span><span>\t\tmsg </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">=</span><span> f</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 153, 0);\">'Failed to upload file to index {index}: {str(e)}'</span><span>\n</span><span>\t\t</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(221, 74, 104);\">print</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">(</span><span>msg</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">)</span><span>\n</span><span>\t\t</span><span class=\"token control-flow\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 119, 170);\">return</span><span> </span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\" style=\"color: rgb(221, 74, 104);\">ActionResult</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">(</span><span>error</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">=</span><span>msg</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">)</span></code></div></pre>\n<div>实现并注册了这个工具后，浏览器就增添了相应的能力。</div>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.25rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">正常设置上传的图片</h3>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/mi1hiye61y_img2.jpg\" alt=\"20250324_513.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>当然，碰到棘手的任务，你还可以摇人，让人工处理，实现如下：</div>\n<pre><div style=\"color: black; background: transparent; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; white-space: pre; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none; padding: 0px; margin: 0.5em 0px; overflow: initial; display: block; border: none;\"><code class=\"language-javascript\" style=\"white-space: pre; color: black; background: none; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none;\"><span>@controller</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token method property-access\" style=\"color: rgb(221, 74, 104);\">action</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">(</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 153, 0);\">'Ask user for information'</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">)</span><span>\n</span><span>def </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(221, 74, 104);\">ask_human</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">(</span><span>question</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">:</span><span> str</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">)</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">-</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">&gt;</span><span> str</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">:</span><span>\n</span><span>    </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(221, 74, 104);\">input</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">(</span><span>f</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 153, 0);\">'\\n等待人工介入\\n'</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">)</span><span>\n</span><span>    </span><span class=\"token control-flow\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 119, 170);\">return</span><span> </span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\" style=\"color: rgb(221, 74, 104);\">ActionResult</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">(</span><span>extracted_content</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">=</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 153, 0);\">\"finished\"</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">)</span></code></div></pre>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.25rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">两个网站都提交成功了</h3>\n<div>1\n<img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/mi1hiye61y_img3.jpg\" alt=\"20250324_510.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>2\n<img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/mi1hiye61y_img4.jpg\" alt=\"20250324_514.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">博客评论</h2>\n<div>博客评论的注册流程比较复杂，涉及浏览邮件，以及识别验证码。\n但是也可以通过实现相应的工具来办到，比如imap。\n代码中利用Gmail接受email的逻辑没有去掉，所以改一改prompt，这个代码也可以用来搞博客评论。我还在想办法优化这些。</div>\n<div>如果你遇到了问题，可以随时问我；如果你成功提高了博客评论的成功率或者找到了其他优化的办法，也欢迎分享。</div>",
